        "en": "After a relaxed start at Stora torget and the old Tovastugan house, take the bus to the harbor cluster. Spend midday exploring Nyköpingshus castle and the Sörmlands Museum. In the afternoon, walk along the waterfront to the Piren pier before heading back."
